Shreyas_Ionic_AMC/05_DATA_OFFICE/data/
# ...except the ISIN master. It is the ONLY exact join key between a client's holdings file (CAS
# statements carry ISINs, not our symbols) and the scored universe. Without it shipped, client_intake
# falls back to name-prefix guessing -- the banned fuzzy match -- and a fresh model book comes back
# entirely unmatched with every score blank. It is 2,404 rows of public NSE reference data, no PII.
!Shreyas_Ionic_AMC/05_DATA_OFFICE/data/
!Shreyas_Ionic_AMC/05_DATA_OFFICE/data/isin_master.csv

